# Industry template packages (FI 5). A pack installs every library template in the categories it lists plus any extra template keys.
# Every pack carries the same CAPA set (report, action plan, root cause worksheet, effectiveness check and log).
pack automotive | Automotive | Advanced product quality planning, production part approval, process FMEA, control plan, run at rate and launch readiness templates. | APQP; PPAP | capa-report; capa-action-plan; capa-root-cause-worksheet; capa-effectiveness-check; capa-log
pack aerospace | Aerospace | First article inspection, configuration control and process verification templates. | FAI; CONFIGURATION | capa-report; capa-action-plan; capa-root-cause-worksheet; capa-effectiveness-check; capa-log
pack medical-device | Medical device | Design history file, device master record, device history record, validation and CAPA templates. | DESIGN_DEVICE | capa-report; capa-action-plan; capa-root-cause-worksheet; capa-effectiveness-check; capa-log
pack electronics | Electronics | Electronics manufacturing templates. | | capa-report; capa-action-plan; capa-root-cause-worksheet; capa-effectiveness-check; capa-log
pack manufacturing | Manufacturing | Nonconformance, CAPA, audit, calibration and supplier quality templates. | NONCONFORMANCE; AUDIT; CALIBRATION; SUPPLIER | capa-report; capa-action-plan; capa-root-cause-worksheet; capa-effectiveness-check; capa-log
